      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We discovered that at Halloween at The Pug it was super easy to get the crash and one cause seems to be Unity video players and the newer audio/video resync functionality having trouble when under serious load. @{5fa30b66b36d4b12af626dc8|full_name} knows more. This also happens on live _when under serious load_. \nBut hitching from the menus can cause the same crash in the beta even in an empty instance. \nOn live with the resync feature on, the menus cause no such hitching or crashes in low pop/high perf conditions or even medium perf conditions.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
