      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5df86a5bfc2e6975420f5c28|full_name} @{5fa30b66b36d4b12af626dc8|full_name} does this mean we can turn resync back on since this was marked complete? Was that indeed the issue?\nThere are no details here or in the patch notes (yet).",
