  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Seems like the game gets stuck playing the close menu sound in a loop and then crashes. Doesn't always happen. Seems more likely to happen in certain worlds and/or with the camera out. Also if you close the menu before its animation finishes might have an effect?\nI have observed this happening in this world for now: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4904dbe3-2b37-4452-ab23-4506f84ea884",
